# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

.env*
# ...except the test environment, which holds no secrets — every value in it is
# a placeholder pointing at the MSW fake. CI needs it, and without it Vite
# leaves VITE_SUPABASE_URL undefined and the whole suite fails to boot.
!.env.test
# ...and the template for the brochure mirror, which is all empty keys and
# comments. The real .env.mirror holds a live Odoo API key and stays ignored.
!.env.mirror.example

.scratch

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
coverage

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
*.sql
# ...but anything deliberately organized under supabase/ (migrations,
# one-off admin scripts, etc.) is a record of what was run against the
# database and must be tracked. This blanket *.sql rule is why none were
# committed before.
!supabase/**/*.sql
*.txt

# TestSprite
.testsprite/
testsprite_tests/
MEETING.MD

supabase/.temp
supabase/.branches
supabase/.cache

# Cursor
/.cursor

