TEST-SCENARIOS.md

Video Script -*

# Skill scratch — critique output and live-preview state, not project files.
.impeccable/

# Reference PDFs pulled from Odoo while working on a deal. A sales order or
# quotation carries customer-facing pricing and therefore the margin on a live
# deal (see §10 of docs/sor-procurement-flow-decisions.md). Keeping them out of
# the repo is the same rule, applied to the thing itself rather than to what
# gets attached to a task.
docs/*.pdf
.vercel

.agents/*

.claude/*

# Generated lint report — regenerate with `npx eslint . -f json -o eslint.json`
eslint.json

# Local pre-baseline safety dumps (ledgers + schema), not repo content —
# supabase/schema/ is the tracked, reviewed mirror.
.baseline-backup/
